&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;div&gt;Mattermost is the leading collaborative workflow platform for defense, intelligence, security, and critical infrastructure. Trusted by the U.S. Department of War and Fortune 500s, our platform runs on-premises and in private clouds, delivering secure messaging, file sharing, workflow automation, audio/screenshare, and project management—all with full data and operational control. Mattermost powers high-stakes workflows across mission planning, real-time, real-world operations, DevSecOps, incident response, and cyber defense—enabling secure collaboration from tactical edge and DDIL environments to enterprise HQ. Teams operate across web, desktop, and mobile, with embedded interoperability for Microsoft Teams, Outlook, and Microsoft 365.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;To learn more, visit&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.mattermost.com/&quot;&gt;www.mattermost.com&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;We are seeking an experienced and results-driven&lt;strong&gt; Federal Account Manager (AM) &lt;/strong&gt;who is collaborative, territory-aligned sales role that operates alongside Federal Account Executives (AEs). AMs independently manage defined Federal expansion and renewal motions while exercising sound judgment on when to partner with AEs on larger or more complex opportunities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities Include&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Expansion Ownership&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead expansions within existing accounts when scope and complexity allow&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify upsell and cross-sell opportunities through customer engagement and usage insights&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with AEs on expansions that become larger, more strategic, or more complex&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage inbound expansion requests from existing customers (e.g., incremental license additions)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Renewal Management (Value-Driven)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own renewals requiring active customer engagement, risk mitigation, or expansion discovery&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate cross-functionally to ensure smooth, on-time renewals&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Become a trusted advisor to customers by helping to realize the value of Mattermost and building business cases to support renewals&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Federal Sales &amp;amp; Ecosystem Exposure&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Gain hands-on experience with the Federal buying cycle and procurement considerations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Engage with Federal System Integrators (FSIs) and partner-led opportunities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Territory Enablement &amp;amp; Hygiene&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as a capacity multiplier for Federal AEs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain strong CRM hygiene, forecasting accuracy, and deal documentation by owning the renewal &amp;amp; expansion records for all assigned accounts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Share insights and learnings to improve territory execution&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Required Background / Skills&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3–5+ years of experience in sales, account management, renewal management, or commercial closing roles&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to run multiple sales cycles in parallel&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong discovery, communication, and deal execution skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience using CRM systems (Salesforce preferred)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;This role may require the candidate to obtain and maintain a U.S. security clearance in the future.&lt;br&gt;as such, applicants must be &lt;strong&gt;U.S. citizens&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;eligible to obtain a U.S. government security clearance&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred Qualifications:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience selling into US Federal or regulated environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exposure to Federal procurement or partner-led sales motions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;SaaS or enterprise technology sales experience&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Target Salary Range: $100,000 to $130,000 USD plus commission&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Mattermost takes a market-based approach to pay and pay may vary depending on your location. The successful candidate’s starting pay will be determined based on job-related skills, experience, qualifications, work location, and market conditions. These ranges may be modified in the future.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;div&gt;Mattermost is an EEO Employer, we are a remote-first, open-source company.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;We are continually working to expand our hiring in more countries and regions, ensuring compliance with local laws and regulations, which takes time.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Mattermost values your unique perspective—we welcome all applicants. We encourage individuals from all backgrounds to apply and are committed to assessing candidates based on their skills and qualifications. We do not tolerate discrimination against staff or applicants based on race, religion, national origin, age, disability, pregnancy status, veteran status, or other personal characteristics.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;If you require accommodations during the interview process, please let us know—we’re happy to assist.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;div&gt;Mattermost is the leading collaborative workflow platform for defense, intelligence, security, and critical infrastructure. Trusted by the U.S. Department of War and Fortune 500s, our platform runs on-premises and in private clouds, delivering secure messaging, file sharing, workflow automation, audio/screenshare, and project management—all with full data and operational control. Mattermost powers high-stakes workflows across mission planning, real-time, real-world operations, DevSecOps, incident response, and cyber defense—enabling secure collaboration from tactical edge and DDIL environments to enterprise HQ. Teams operate across web, desktop, and mobile, with embedded interoperability for Microsoft Teams, Outlook, and Microsoft 365.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;To learn more, visit&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.mattermost.com/&quot;&gt;www.mattermost.com&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;140&quot; data-end=&quot;371&quot;&gt;Mattermost is seeking a &lt;strong&gt;Commercial Account Manager (CAM) – UK &lt;/strong&gt;to support and accelerate commercial growth across the region. This is a collaborative, territory-aligned sales role that operates alongside Account Executives (AEs).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;373&quot; data-end=&quot;711&quot;&gt;The CAM independently manages defined commercial sales motions while exercising strong judgment on when to partner with AEs on larger or more complex opportunities. This role is ideal for a commercially driven seller who thrives in a fast-paced SaaS environment and enjoys balancing net-new acquisition, expansion, and renewal management.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 data-start=&quot;718&quot; data-end=&quot;735&quot;&gt;What You’ll Do&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3 data-start=&quot;737&quot; data-end=&quot;762&quot;&gt;Inbound Net New Sales&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul data-start=&quot;763&quot; data-end=&quot;1011&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;763&quot; data-end=&quot;826&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;765&quot; data-end=&quot;826&quot;&gt;Own and execute inbound-led net-new opportunities&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;827&quot; data-end=&quot;925&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;829&quot; data-end=&quot;925&quot;&gt;Qualify and close small to mid-sized deals for customers not aligned to strategic AE territories&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;926&quot; data-end=&quot;1011&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;928&quot; data-end=&quot;1011&quot;&gt;Run discovery, qualification, objection handling, and closing motions independently&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3 data-start=&quot;1013&quot; data-end=&quot;1036&quot;&gt;Expansion Ownership&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul data-start=&quot;1037&quot; data-end=&quot;1388&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;1037&quot; data-end=&quot;1111&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1039&quot; data-end=&quot;1111&quot;&gt;Lead expansions within existing accounts when scope and complexity allow&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;1112&quot; data-end=&quot;1205&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1114&quot; data-end=&quot;1205&quot;&gt;Identify upsell and cross-sell opportunities through customer engagement and usage insights&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;1206&quot; data-end=&quot;1290&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1208&quot; data-end=&quot;1290&quot;&gt;Partner with AEs on expansions that become larger, more strategic, or more complex&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;1291&quot; data-end=&quot;1388&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1293&quot; data-end=&quot;1388&quot;&gt;Manage inbound expansion requests from existing customers (e.g., incremental license additions)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3 data-start=&quot;1390&quot; data-end=&quot;1427&quot;&gt;Renewal Management (Value-Driven)&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul data-start=&quot;1428&quot; data-end=&quot;1718&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;1428&quot; data-end=&quot;1520&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1430&quot; data-end=&quot;1520&quot;&gt;Own renewals requiring active customer engagement, risk mitigation, or expansion discovery&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;1521&quot; data-end=&quot;1588&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1523&quot; data-end=&quot;1588&quot;&gt;Collaborate cross-functionally to ensure smooth, on-time renewals&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;1589&quot; data-end=&quot;1718&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1591&quot; data-end=&quot;1718&quot;&gt;Serve as a trusted advisor by helping customers realize the value of Mattermost and building business cases to support renewals&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3 data-start=&quot;1720&quot; data-end=&quot;1750&quot;&gt;Sales &amp;amp; Ecosystem Exposure&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul data-start=&quot;1751&quot; data-end=&quot;1846&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;1751&quot; data-end=&quot;1846&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1753&quot; data-end=&quot;1846&quot;&gt;Gain hands-on experience with the full buying cycle and commercial procurement considerations&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3 data-start=&quot;1848&quot; data-end=&quot;1882&quot;&gt;Territory Enablement &amp;amp; Hygiene&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul data-start=&quot;1883&quot; data-end=&quot;2197&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;1883&quot; data-end=&quot;1936&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1885&quot; data-end=&quot;1936&quot;&gt;Act as a capacity multiplier for Account Executives&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;1937&quot; data-end=&quot;2012&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1939&quot; data-end=&quot;2012&quot;&gt;Maintain strong CRM hygiene, forecasting accuracy, and deal documentation&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;2013&quot; data-end=&quot;2122&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;2015&quot; data-end=&quot;2122&quot;&gt;Own renewal and expansion records for assigned accounts, as well as net-new sales records within your scope&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;2123&quot; data-end=&quot;2197&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;2125&quot; data-end=&quot;2197&quot;&gt;Share insights and learnings to continuously improve territory execution&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 data-start=&quot;2204&quot; data-end=&quot;2235&quot;&gt;Required Background / Skills&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3 data-start=&quot;2237&quot; data-end=&quot;2249&quot;&gt;Required&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul data-start=&quot;2250&quot; data-end=&quot;2536&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;2250&quot; data-end=&quot;2354&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;2252&quot; data-end=&quot;2354&quot;&gt;2–5+ years of experience in sales, account management, renewal management, or commercial closing roles&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;2355&quot; data-end=&quot;2421&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;2357&quot; data-end=&quot;2421&quot;&gt;Demonstrated ability to manage multiple sales cycles in parallel&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;2422&quot; data-end=&quot;2482&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;2424&quot; data-end=&quot;2482&quot;&gt;Strong discovery, communication, and deal execution skills&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;2483&quot; data-end=&quot;2536&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;2485&quot; data-end=&quot;2536&quot;&gt;Experience using CRM systems (Salesforce preferred)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3 data-start=&quot;2538&quot; data-end=&quot;2551&quot;&gt;Preferred&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul data-start=&quot;2552&quot; data-end=&quot;2696&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;2552&quot; data-end=&quot;2600&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;2554&quot; data-end=&quot;2600&quot;&gt;Experience selling into regulated environments&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;2601&quot; data-end=&quot;2647&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;2603&quot; data-end=&quot;2647&quot;&gt;Exposure to commercial procurement processes&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;2648&quot; data-end=&quot;2696&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;2650&quot; data-end=&quot;2696&quot;&gt;SaaS or enterprise technology sales experience&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Mattermost takes a market-based approach to pay and pay may vary depending on your location. The successful candidate’s starting pay will be determined based on job-related skills, experience, qualifications, work location, and market conditions. These ranges may be modified in the future.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;div&gt;Mattermost is an EEO Employer, we are a remote-first, open-source company.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;We are continually working to expand our hiring in more countries and regions, ensuring compliance with local laws and regulations, which takes time.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Mattermost values your unique perspective—we welcome all applicants. We encourage individuals from all backgrounds to apply and are committed to assessing candidates based on their skills and qualifications. We do not tolerate discrimination against staff or applicants based on race, religion, national origin, age, disability, pregnancy status, veteran status, or other personal characteristics.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;If you require accommodations during the interview process, please let us know—we’re happy to assist.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;div&gt;Mattermost is the leading collaborative workflow platform for defense, intelligence, security, and critical infrastructure. Trusted by the U.S. Department of War and Fortune 500s, our platform runs on-premises and in private clouds, delivering secure messaging, file sharing, workflow automation, audio/screenshare, and project management—all with full data and operational control. Mattermost powers high-stakes workflows across mission planning, real-time, real-world operations, DevSecOps, incident response, and cyber defense—enabling secure collaboration from tactical edge and DDIL environments to enterprise HQ. Teams operate across web, desktop, and mobile, with embedded interoperability for Microsoft Teams, Outlook, and Microsoft 365.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;To learn more, visit&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.mattermost.com/&quot;&gt;www.mattermost.com&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;section page-centered&quot; data-qa=&quot;salary-range&quot;&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Mattermost Federal&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot;&gt;Mattermost Federal builds secure collaboration platforms used by U.S. defense, intelligence, and national security organizations operating in the most demanding environments in the world.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot;&gt;We are looking for Forward Deployed Engineers (FDEs) who want to solve real operational problems alongside mission teams. In this role you will work directly with operators, analysts, and engineers to deploy and build systems that are used every day in mission environments.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot;&gt;This is not a traditional engineering role. You will operate close to the mission, often inside classified environments, working through ambiguity and building solutions that have immediate operational impact.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot;&gt;The problems you will work on here are hard, ambiguous, and consequential.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;[li_&amp;amp;]:mb-0 [li_&amp;amp;]:mt-1 [li_&amp;amp;]:gap-1 [&amp;amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:pb-1 list-disc flex flex-col gap-1 pl-8 mb-3&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Work directly with defense and intelligence organizations to understand operational problems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Deploy and integrate Mattermost in classified and mission-critical environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Build plugins, integrations, and automations that enable operational workflows&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Prototype new capabilities quickly and iterate based on operator feedback&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Debug complex systems operating in constrained environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Help shape the evolution of the Mattermost platform based on mission needs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot;&gt;You will move between writing code, deploying infrastructure, and working directly with operators, often within the same week. Travel is typically approximately one week per month onsite with customers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We&#39;re Looking For&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;[li_&amp;amp;]:mb-0 [li_&amp;amp;]:mt-1 [li_&amp;amp;]:gap-1 [&amp;amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:pb-1 list-disc flex flex-col gap-1 pl-8 mb-3&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Strong engineering ability (Go, Python, TypeScript, or similar)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Comfort working across the full stack from infrastructure to applications&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Ability to solve open-ended technical problems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Strong communication skills with both engineers and operators&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Willingness to travel approximately one week per month&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice to Have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;[li_&amp;amp;]:mb-0 [li_&amp;amp;]:mt-1 [li_&amp;amp;]:gap-1 [&amp;amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:pb-1 list-disc flex flex-col gap-1 pl-8 mb-3&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Experience working with DoD, IC, or national security organizations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Experience deploying systems in secure or classified environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Familiarity with Kubernetes, distributed systems, and APIs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Experience building integrations or operational tooling&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI-Forward Engineering&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot;&gt;Mattermost Federal is aggressively adopting AI-enabled workflows across mission operations. FDEs will be among the first engineers deploying and operationalizing AI capabilities in secure environments, including:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;[li_&amp;amp;]:mb-0 [li_&amp;amp;]:mt-1 [li_&amp;amp;]:gap-1 [&amp;amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:pb-1 list-disc flex flex-col gap-1 pl-8 mb-3&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;AI agents that summarize operational channels and generate SITREPs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;AI-assisted mission timelines and decision logs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Knowledge retrieval across operational history&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;AI tools that help operators understand fast-moving mission data&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why This Role Exists&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot;&gt;The best software is built close to the problem. Forward Deployed Engineers at Mattermost Federal work directly with the people using the systems we build. You will see problems firsthand, build solutions quickly, and deploy them into environments where reliability, security, and speed matter.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Compensation&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot;&gt;Mattermost takes a market-based approach to pay. Actual compensation may vary based on location, skills, experience, qualifications, and market conditions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot;&gt;Target Salary Range: $130,000 – $200,000 USD&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;U.S. Eligibility &amp;amp; Compliance&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
