&lt;p&gt;This role may require obtaining and maintaining a U.S. government security clearance. Candidates must meet federal eligibility requirements to be considered. &lt;em&gt;For more information visit&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.state.gov/securityclearances&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;Security Clearances — United States Department of State&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Applicants must meet eligibility requirements for access to export-controlled information as defined by U.S. export control laws, including EAR and ITAR. &lt;em&gt;For more information visit the&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.bis.doc.gov/&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;Bureau of Industry and Security&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;and the&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.pmddtc.state.gov/&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;Directorate of Defense Trade Controls&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
